Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Portef\[OSlash]ljeopgave 1", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904975329444317*^9, 3.904975332237374*^9}, 
   3.9049753941246414`*^9, {3.9049755159109926`*^9, 3.904975518530716*^9}, {
   3.9049772937659335`*^9, 3.90497729386621*^9}, {4.002084516167799*^9, 
   4.002084516231159*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33278281-fb48-4a86-8a7c-\
64498c114e35"],

Cell["\<\
I denne opgave kr\[AE]ves det, at der bruges m\[OSlash]nstre og betingelser \
til kontrol af datastrukturer for alle funktioner\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049772910208273`*^9, 
  3.9049773488427296`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e51b813b-8452-4b20-97ef-\
f0d2980b2c30"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["a)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049755231147485`*^9, 3.9049755235387125`*^9}, 
   3.9688119787775497`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"aa3d7e1f-bf02-4339-9f62-\
c4ed9c2d47c0"],

Cell["\<\
Skriv en funktion InCollision der som input tager en cirkelformet robots \
radius og koordinat, en liste af cirkelformede forhindringer med radius og \
koordinater samt en sikkerhedsafstand.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049756852072163`*^9, 
  3.904975732638603*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"61037cc1-727f-4644-89ea-\
ed532e6cbfe2"],

Cell["Funktionen skal alts\[ARing] tage input som eksempel herunder", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904975737665576*^9, 3.904975741436236*^9}, {
  3.9049758093773785`*^9, 
  3.9049758159564667`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e5aecbf9-ae75-4dec-9d8e-\
e74c9ed87e7b"],

Cell["\<\
InCollision[{robotRadius, {x, y}}, {{r1, {x1, y1}}, {r2, {x2, y2}}, ..., {rn, \
{xn, yn}}}, safetyDistance]\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904975752158093*^9, 3.9049758253439054`*^9}, 
   3.9049759551504383`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"84161e06-d1fc-40eb-af96-\
4308ca6d65f5"],

Cell["\<\
Og et eksempel herunder med to forhindringer samt en sikkerhedsafstand p\
\[ARing] 0.05m\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049758332962437`*^9, 
  3.9049758504669037`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f647270e-8904-4853-90bb-\
73b316471f10"],

Cell["\<\
InCollision[{0.3, {0, 1}}, {{1, {1.5, 1.3}}, {0.5, {2, 2}}}, 0.05]\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.904975682667433*^9, {3.904975852845276*^9, 
   3.9049758533095083`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33caf658-636a-4b16-b11b-\
59095b1e7c95"],

Cell["\<\
Funktionen skal returnere True s\[ARing]fremt der er risiko for kollision og \
False, hvis der ikke er risiko for kollision. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904975863172682*^9, 3.9049758931379857`*^9}, {
   3.904976136740487*^9, 3.9049761423786135`*^9}, 
   4.002683860826685*^9},ExpressionUUID->"52c1ff71-944f-449c-ae0e-\
e00137f948ec"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["b)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904976901142289*^9, 3.904976901559101*^9}, 
   3.9688119827890778`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0f5108ad-2c7e-4f62-b7c1-\
ffb71fe843c4"],

Cell["\<\
Skriv en funktion LinearPath, som laver en line\[AE]r sti mellem to punkter \
med en opl\[OSlash]sning givet som input til funktionen. Funktionen skal alts\
\[ARing] se s\[ARing]ledes ud:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049769034511538`*^9, 3.904976971792745*^9}, 
   3.90497707369252*^9},ExpressionUUID->"cdd6c9cb-0e2f-425e-bb9e-\
16ce83301091"],

Cell["LinearPath[{x1, y1}, {x2, y2}, interval]", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049769300546513`*^9, 3.9049769310425763`*^9}, {
  3.904976974687928*^9, 
  3.904977021849044*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ab3d400c-0b11-4eb3-9dd5-\
bc1a80f49dba"],

Cell["og som eksempel kunne dette v\[AE]re", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049769986782455`*^9, 
  3.904977002840387*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42375cff-57d0-487c-ad6b-\
be490ddf0970"],

Cell["LinearPath[{0, 1}, {1, 3}, 0.05]", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904977013385483*^9, 
  3.904977042656801*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bbae1e2c-6bfc-4fc6-b437-\
171ea59b1ed9"],

Cell["\<\
hvor der alts\[ARing] for hver 5 cm laves et nyt punkt. Alle punkter skal \
returneres i en liste.

UPDATE: LinearPath skal beregne afstanden mellem de to punkter og \
s\[OSlash]rge for at afstanden bliver den samme mellem hvert punkt. Dvs. \
afstanden \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]interval\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] skal alts\
\[ARing] justeres, s\[ARing] den maksimale afstand mellem punkterne er 0.05, \
men samtidig er s\[ARing] t\[AE]t p\[ARing] 0.05 som muligt i det givne \
eksempel. Tilsvarende, hvis funktionen kaldes som LinearPath[{0, 1}, {1, 3}, \
0.03] g\[AE]lder det samme alts\[ARing] med 3 cm mellem hvert punkt.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904977044416013*^9, 3.904977097698642*^9}, {
  4.0026773524647655`*^9, 4.0026773603726673`*^9}, {4.0026774175701237`*^9, 
  4.0026775389839897`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5479710c-659f-44b0-95a2-\
118138620cc9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["c)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049769256179657`*^9, 3.904976925994064*^9}, 
   3.9688119858163624`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"b7d5b385-880a-40e3-a25c-\
46994cd95a19"],

Cell["\<\
Skriv en funktion PathCollision som ved brug af output fra LinearPath og \
InCollision afg\[OSlash]r om en sti har en kollision. Formatet for funktionen \
bliver s\[ARing]ledes\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904977846780787*^9, 
  3.9049779101993237`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f8870fc0-0445-4d73-9f0a-\
d8b81da6b666"],

Cell["\<\
PathCollision[{radiusRobot, {{x1, y1}, {x2, y2}, ..., {xn, yn}}}, {{or1, \
{ox1, oy1}}, {or2, {ox2, oy2}}, ..., {orn, {oxn, oyn}}}, safetyDistance]\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049779216768465`*^9, 
  3.9049780205768127`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"885db92c-3b6f-4f1e-b43d-\
f9a9dc014cba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "hvor radiusRobot er radius af robotten, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["x", "i"], ",", 
     SubscriptBox["y", "i"]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "9f0b975d-22fc-460a-97ec-6457b81bb9fb"],
 " er alle punkter, som robotten passerer som beregnet med funktionen \
LinearPath. Punkterne ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["or", "i"], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       SubscriptBox["ox", "i"], ",", 
       SubscriptBox["oy", "i"]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"fbc2b1dc-9809-42a8-9849-b8c08121930b"],
 " er forhindringernes radius og koordinater. Afstanden \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]safetyDistance\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] er den afstand, \
som vi v\[AE]lger som sikkerhedsafstand."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.904978023544341*^9, 3.9049781757365265`*^9}, {
  4.00267772974601*^9, 4.0026777897647877`*^9}, {4.002677872914652*^9, 
  4.0026779560621166`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7702cb27-45b8-4d78-8efd-\
6dc3d2d85d34"],

Cell["\<\
Funktionen skal returnerer en liste af True/False for hvert punkt hvor der er \
hhv. risiko for kollision eller ej.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049781772042418`*^9, 3.904978198441016*^9}, {
  3.9049787102073517`*^9, 
  3.9049787349038663`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3c99a333-29d3-4f2b-b39c-\
ed6645efc5ad"],

Cell["Et kald kunne se s\[ARing]ledes ud", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049782053075943`*^9, 
  3.904978209801833*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"85e76795-ee3d-4092-b3eb-\
3b2ef7c48adb"],

Cell["\<\
path = LinearPath[{0, 1}, {1, 3}, 0.05];
obstacles = {{1, {1.5, 1.3}}, {0.5, {2.3, 2.6}}, {0.25, {0.5, 2.6}}};
PathCollision[{0.3, path}, obstacles, 0.05]\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049782140028276`*^9, 3.9049783152495112`*^9}, {
  3.907903724076711*^9, 
  3.90790372660382*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fab47b11-5dbb-465b-9f86-\
deaf49526713"],

Cell["\<\
eller ved brug af flere punkter forhindringer og en lidt anden sti:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002677572535387*^9, 4.0026775815798206`*^9}, {
  4.0026776724546757`*^9, 
  4.002677682324562*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e1417909-7047-b049-8354-\
61337e505932"],

Cell["\<\
path = LinearPath[{0, 1}, {2, 3}, 0.05];
obstacles = {{1, {1.5, 1.3}}, {0.5, {2.3, 2.6}}, {0.25, {0.5, 2.6}}, {0.2, \
{0.2, 2.2}}};
PathCollision[{0.3, path}, obstacles, 0.05]\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049782140028276`*^9, 3.9049783152495112`*^9}, {
  3.907903724076711*^9, 3.90790372660382*^9}, {4.0026776378459187`*^9, 
  4.002677685556402*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bd4b6148-db1f-1247-b886-\
586cde46db2d"],

Cell["\<\
hvor stien er gemt i variablen path og forhindringerne er gemt i obstacles \
variablen.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049783332792764`*^9, 
  3.90497834904385*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3630dd63-3367-4c58-ab36-\
ed47b337c340"],

Cell["Output bliver alts\[ARing] en liste af True/False som f.eks.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049787403405457`*^9, 
  3.904978748842462*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"695e5ee6-4dc0-4abd-991d-\
5d3a55eb8dc5"],

Cell["\<\
{False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,False,\
False,False,False,False,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,\
True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,\
True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,\
True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,\
True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,\
True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,True,False,False,False}\
\>", "CodeText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9049787617555647`*^9, 
  3.9049787653355637`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bbfc90f4-5eb4-4ee3-9cc8-\
dee02ca9c412"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
